<title>UK: Export Credit Bank Turkey sets $200 mln in bonds.</title>
<headline>Export Credit Bank Turkey sets $200 mln in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Export Credit Bank of Turkey</p>
<p>has launched a $100 million three-year fixed-rate bond and a</p>
<p>$100 million three-year FRN, lead manager Salomon Brothers</p>
<p>International Ltd said.</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     9.00	MATURITY    18.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.85     PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	+300 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT AUGUST 2000 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +250 BP   PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY B1	  ISS PRICE  99.355    FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   B	   REOFFER    99.355</p>
<p> LISTING    =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCH SPREAD 6M LIBOR +275 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
